// spec: EXP-011, EXP-012
//
// ⚠️ Expected to FAIL compiled, because of C-14: compiled code does not check
// arity AT ALL. The extra argument is discarded and the program continues --
// this case is the reproduction of that, and it was invisible for as long as
// the case opted out of the compiled half.

function One (A); begin Exit A; end

WriteLn (One (1));

// EXP-011: a call checks arity.
WriteLn (One (1, 2));
